# philosophy: pavement saves nature

> **pavement saves nature.** pavement is reusable prethought (brief, howto, term cluster, resolved dispute, route): somebody spent the energy, and the next traveler pays a read.

write the briefs that will be walked, then walk them.

| failure | shape | fix |
|---|---|---|
| braided trail | second path beside a serviceable one, unlooked-for | check the pavement first |
| rut | conformity to a found path, untested | precedent is a reason to look, never to conform |

mend the tread: if a paved path is bad, fix the pavement, never walk beside it. none exists → walk it and leave a route.
